{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のblogで焼き肉メンバーで\nヤマトマトちゃんの名前が抜けてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとにすみませーーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんとまたーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では気を取り直して、\nこの前みくもちゃんblogにまあやの事沢山書いてあった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから今日はみくもちゃんの事書くよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"安藤美雲ちゃんの取り扱い説明書"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1いつも単品の硬い食物を持ち歩いている[ちくわや、サキイカなど]"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2英語がペラペラで凄く賢いです(いつも教えてもらっております！教え方が素晴らしくパーフェクトです)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3自虐ばかりいっている(ポジティブSay !)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4いつも笑っていて冗談ばかりいっております(一緒にいると笑ってばかりで腹筋鍛えられて一石二鳥)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5とにかく自分の事よりたにんを優先する(ほんとに素晴らしく尊敬する人間像です)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※テンションが上がると私でもついていけなくなるので優しく見守ってあげましょう〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し\n・テスト勉強する時、昼する？夜する？\n休みの日は昼ぐらいからかな？\n平日は夕方から夜にかけてです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・花粉症とかは大丈夫？\n私は花粉症じゃないので大丈夫です\n皆さんは大丈夫？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・背はなんセンチになった？\nまだ測ってないのでわかりません(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・birthdayライブまあやタオル持って行ったよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージからもタオルやうちわみえてスッゴク嬉しかった\nありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・お母さんは何かお土産かったんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元から買ってきたよ紅葉まんじゅう\n広島に帰るときは『ゴマタマゴ』ってゆーのをかってた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・女の子はどうして嫉妬するの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きだからじゃないかな？(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・健康管理で気を付けてる事は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青汁を飲んでるよっ\n皆さんに前コメントで教えてもらったから\n以上♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんとあしゅりんの漢字間違えおしえてくださり有り難う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の答え\n昼御飯は"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海老アボカドでしたー＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業シーズンですが"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業の方"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにか卒業の時の思出話とかありますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/05/8361239/0005.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}